    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "75407265f8f7ef97bba9b0ef723171602784c871873da2514d06545592cbdbc4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いや、違いますよ？\nっていうか、さっきからベルティオさんが捕まえたそのオウム、\nすごく目を血走らせてこちらを見てるんですが。",
      "jp_sha256": "89ca2f2d605c30b18d8bb0f32a5f49be2ba0d119e541204527b9d375fa25eacf",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아니, 다르거든요?\n그보다 아까부터 벨티오 씨가 잡은 앵무새가\n눈을 잔뜩 충혈한 채 이쪽을 보고 있는데요.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3a2bd5fce33f87fdbcb3efd1f06e1572a4c03cdaba67ff1bbacd243528517b9e:000000_-7136409289347030908:g0:r16",
      "row_index_0based": 16,
      "serialized_row_index": 16,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "<Off>",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "いや、違いますよ？\nっていうか、さっきからベルティオさんが捕まえたそのオウム、\nすごく目を血走らせてこちらを見てるんですが。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f673be44e43165794e60c3dcf6e32c9a2f978cb033b698f5a1756c7e70d62a88",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ああ、このままじゃ首の皮は役に立たねぇな。\nＨＭＣオウム。ハイパーミュージッククリエイターオウムは、\n綺麗な歌声を発している状態の首の皮にこそ、価値がある。",
      "jp_sha256": "8fdb77d5f6144c364378a1c6a3418ac30ec5100adaf94821dad4fc239c49591a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래, 이대로는 목가죽이 쓸모없어.\nHMC 앵무새, 하이퍼 뮤직 크리에이터 앵무새는\n아름답게 노래하는 상태의 목가죽에 가치가 있거든.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3a2bd5fce33f87fdbcb3efd1f06e1572a4c03cdaba67ff1bbacd243528517b9e:000000_-7136409289347030908:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ベルティオ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ああ、このままじゃ首の皮は役に立たねぇな。\nＨＭＣオウム。ハイパーミュージッククリエイターオウムは、\n綺麗な歌声を発している状態の首の皮にこそ、価値がある。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ベルティオ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "320494d892de4fc39310bece41d0f203e1dc566e4c22bf173b488b52590ae864",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "その首の皮は伸縮性があって、船の帆を作るのに最適なんだよ。\nって、ことで。ご主人、ちょっと失礼するぜ。",
      "jp_sha256": "7a6d9a1b5e3f7dccec4b6c190d9f7562987940a856dac3804b63e6e2c5565f91",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 목가죽은 신축성이 있어 배의 돛을 만들기에 딱 좋아.\n그럼 주인, 잠깐 실례할게.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
